  "content": "\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">《毀滅之主》的 Boss 獎勵擴充模組<br><br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1058/637/gauntlet_mini_textured_2.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"246\" height=\"400\"><br><br>迷你拳套<br></span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">地獄拳套的迷你可馴服個體<br>放置迷你拳套物品即可召喚<br>手持下界之星右擊以啟動<br>可用桶裝起<br>餵食紅石粉可治療它<br><br>屬性：</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">- 100 點生命值&nbsp; &nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">- 4 點護甲&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">- 10 點攻擊力<br><br>技能：<br>- 衝拳<br>- 雷射光束<br><br>行為：<br>- 閒逛<br></span><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">- 跟隨<br></span><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">- 待命&nbsp;&nbsp;<br>- 跳舞&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\"><br>死亡時會掉落迷你拳套物品<br>該物品會保存其相關數據<br>需要 1 分鐘充能時間才能再次放置<br>可於設定中開啟發光效果</span></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\"><br>需求：<br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/bosses-of-mass-destruction-forge\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">BOMD (Forge 版)</a></span></p>",
